  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avaana Sustainability Fund - investment in early-stage innovative tech businesses with focus on Climate sectors.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avaana Sustainability Fund is a women led fund which provides investment capital to early-stage innovative tech businesses to help address India&#x2019;s climate challenges while creating opportunities for the UK institutions and investors. Avaana&#x2019;s investment will be directed towards sub-sectors including a) green mobility and supply chains b) tech driven agri solutions and c) energy transition.</narrative>
  </description>
